[65.516, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ I've updated the plan at `/cfg/plans/make-a-plan-for-vectorized-origami.md` with your four answers,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  replacing the open-questions section. I haven't started building anything.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Platforms:** iOS and Android launch together. Every milestone is tested on both, and Android background-\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  kill testing starts in week 3.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Focus:** Road and gravel only for v1. Segments carry a surface tag (paved, gravel or mixed), and the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  ride type field can take mountain biking later without a migration.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Money:** Core recording, the social features, standard challenges and basic club membership stay free.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Pro covers advanced stats, extra challenges and club admin tools. RevenueCat handles subscriptions on both\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  stores, and the server enforces Pro-only features.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Backend:** Supabase, unchanged.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  I also made these changes to the milestones, data model and checks:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Milestone 1:** RevenueCat and the App Store and Play Console accounts are set up here.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Polish and beta milestone:** It now includes the paywall, subscription management and restore purchases.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Data model:** Added a `subscriptions` table, a `ride_type` field on rides, and a `surface` field on\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  segments.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Verification:** Added sandbox-purchase tests on both platforms, plus a check that free users are\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  rejected from Pro endpoints while core flows stay open.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **New risk:** Putting some club tools behind Pro could slow growth. I've noted checking conversion and\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  retention in the beta before fixing the tiers.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  I left indoor rides out of v1, which you didn't mention either way. Say so if you want them in.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
