[134.797, "o", "\r\n\u001b[97m⏺ I took \"push it further\" to mean making the plan more detailed, so I added a \"Deep Dive\" section to\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  `/cfg/plans/make-a-plan-for-vectorized-origami.md`. The file is now about 180 lines. I haven't built\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  anything.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The new sections cover:\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Gamification design:** XP rules, a level curve, streak freezes, about 60 launch badges, auto-scaled\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  challenges, and the segment ladders. It also sets guardrails against rewarding risky riding.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Screens:** The full MVP screen list, from onboarding through the record flow to the detail and settings\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  screens.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Recording engine:** GPS settings, filtering of bad points, auto-pause, recovery after a crash, and an\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  upload queue that survives going offline. Acceptance targets are ±2% distance and under 8% battery per hour.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Backend:** The Edge Functions, how the feed is built, moderation, and privacy zones.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Metrics, growth, legal and engineering practices:** Targets for activation, retention and Pro\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  conversion. Launch tactics include club invite links, shareable ride cards, Strava import and a one-region\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  soft launch. Also covered are compliance and environments/CI.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **First two weeks:** A seven-step task list. It ends with a go/no-go spike: record a one-hour ride on two\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  iOS and two Android devices, including Samsung and Xiaomi, before committing to the recording milestone.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  - **Open items:** Pro pricing (a starting guess of about $4.99 a month or $39.99 a year), the app name, a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  Mapbox versus MapLibre cost review, and the Strava API terms.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The numbers in it (XP values, the level curve, retention and conversion targets, the pricing guess) are\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  starting guesses. The beta should tune them.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  The file also changed on disk after I wrote to it. I didn't look at what changed, so I've left it as is.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  If you want the plan pushed further in a different direction, I could write out the database schema in SQL,\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  wireframe the key screens, or turn the first two weeks into tickets. I could also start scaffolding the Expo\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[97m  project.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
